  "description": "The official collection of get, insert, update and delete helpers for Dapper.net. Also handles lists of entities and optional \"dirty\" tracking of interface-based entities. This fork adds support for DM (Dameng) Database 8 and fixes Postgres lowercase primary key issues in Get and Insert.",
