  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release based on Dapper.Contrib 2.0.78.\n      - Added DM (Dameng) Database 8 adapter\n      - Added ISqlAdapter.GetParameterPrefix() for per-database parameter prefix support\n      - Changed ISqlAdapter.Insert/InsertAsync return type from int to long\n      - Fixed Get/GetAsync cache key to include connection type name\n      - Fixed GetAll cache key to use type.TypeHandle.Value.ToString()\n      - Fixed Insert list parameter prefix to use adapter.GetParameterPrefix()\n      - Fixed Postgres Get<T> to use AppendColumnName in WHERE clause (case mismatch fix)\n      - Fixed Postgres Insert/InsertAsync to use AppendColumnName in RETURNING clause (lowercase key fix)",
